# TH-008: Hydration state changes dissolution heat and water bookkeeping
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CuSO4 0.01mol
measure v1 thermometer
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 chalcanthite 0.01mol
measure v2 thermometer
inspect v2
